Adapted from Rat Stack packages/auth/src/auth-options.ts and
packages/auth/src/current-person-middleware.ts at
f396f76f8ced98d4bc4d510ae8457142cd66db81:
https://github.com/joelhooks/rat-stack

The /auth email/password options and per-request session-to-current-principal
boundary are adapted. Rat Stack's Alchemy/Cloudflare database vendor layers
were inspected; this host uses Better Auth's supported node:sqlite adapter
instead. Demo accounts, fixed dev passwords and devtools were not adopted.

